  (jv$clojure.core/attach-core-doc-meta! "clojure.core" "cond" "Takes a set of test/expr pairs. It evaluates each test one at a\n  time.  If a test returns logical true, cond evaluates and returns\n  the value of the corresponding expr and doesn't evaluate any of the\n  other tests or exprs. (cond) returns nil." (jolt-list (jolt-vector (jolt-symbol #f "&") (jolt-symbol #f "clauses"))) jolt-nil))
